c.imp_aws_aws_lambda_9.schema.body:
This component owns no database tables. It owns the inbound S3 event shape (defined in §10.5), the outbound DAG run configuration, and its two CloudEvents records.

#### Outbound payload — `EgressDagRunConfig` (egress-lambda → egress dag)

This is the single shared shape for the **egress dag** run configuration; §12.5.1 declares the identical object, and the Lambda supplies every required field from the staging manifest.

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://laminar.com/schemas/egress/egress_dag_run_config.json",
  "title": "EgressDagRunConfig",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": ["config_id", "lineage_uuid", "dataset", "staging_s3_key", "target_type", "target_path"],
  "properties": {
    "config_id": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" },
    "lineage_uuid": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" },
    "dataset": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "unified_identity_profile", "pii_restricted_profile",
        "contact_method_subscription", "enriched_campaigns",
        "enriched_campaign_reactions", "room_stay_reservation",
        "restaurant_reservation", "tee_time_reservation", "spa_treatment_reservation"
      ]
    },
    "staging_s3_key": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^staging/[0-9a-fA-F-]{36}/[0-9a-fA-F-]{36}/[a-z0-9_]+/data/$"
    },
    "target_type": { "type": "string", "enum": ["s3", "sftp", "azure_blob", "gcs", "internal_staging"] },
    "target_path": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 }
  }
}
```

#### Telemetry CloudEvents emitted by egress-lambda

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://laminar.com/schemas/egress/egress_lambda_cloud_event.json",
  "title": "EgressLambdaCloudEvent",
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["specversion", "id", "source", "type", "time", "subject", "data"],
